    cap("Three deployment rules: every agent runs in draft mode first, every agent has a human approval gate at the first sensitive step, every agent has a kill switch and a daily summary to a human."),
    ol([
        "Start in shadow mode. The agent runs but does not publish. Compare to human output for 30 days.",
        "Move to draft mode. The agent publishes drafts to the queue. Humans approve.",
        "Move to limited autonomy. Agent ships in low-stakes lanes (internal reports, simple ad variants).",
        "Quarterly audit. Spot-check 5% of agent output. Adjust prompt and rubric.",
        "Annual board memo. What did the agent do, what value did it create, where did it fail.",
        "Always-on kill switch. A single button that stops every running agent.",
    ]),
    h2("What is the realistic ROI on a 2026 marketing agent program?"),
