        "YouTube. In-stream and bumper for storytelling, Discovery for high-intent search behaviour.",
        "Pinterest. Long buying cycles (home renovation, wedding, season planning). Pin saves are a leading indicator.",
        "Reddit. Brand-defending in category subreddits, plus paid placements in niches. Soft sell only.",
        "Retail media. Where buyers shop. Amazon, marketplaces, category retailers.",
