    p("The volume question matters too. A brand running 60 Meta variants a month needs another 30 to 50 for the other channels combined. That is why some brands stop at three channels and run them well. The " + ilink("AI creative pipeline", "ai-creative-100-variants-no-slop") + " covers how to make this manageable."),
