        ("Does MMM work for B2B?", "It can. But B2B usually has lower channel count and longer cycles; MMM is harder to fit."),
        ("Will AI change MMM?", "It already has. Bayesian methods plus generative tools for interpretation are the 2026 stack."),
        ("Should I use Profound-style AI visibility tools too?", "Different question; not measurement. See " + ilink("DIY AI visibility audit", "audit-ai-visibility-without-paying-profound") + "."),
        ("How does this fit with geo-holdouts?", "MMM gives the strategic answer; geo-holdouts validate it causally. See " + ilink("the geo-holdout playbook", "incrementality-testing-geo-holdout-playbook") + "."),
