    p("Magic number is the board's favourite efficiency metric because it ties revenue creation directly to investment. " + link("OpenView Partners", S["openview"]) + " maintains the canonical benchmarks. Trends matter more than absolutes; rising magic number means efficiency is improving."),
    p("The four-quarter trend is more useful than the snapshot. A magic number of 0.6 rising to 0.9 over four quarters is a stronger signal than a static 1.1. Boards reward trajectory more than the headline number."),
